/Type /StructElem
/S /H5
/P 124 0 R
/T (A recursive function could accept the number of attempts remaining and call itself after a wrong OTP. All approaches take O\(a\) time for a attempts. A loop uses O\(1\) auxiliary space; recursion uses O\(a\) call-stack space. A loop is preferable for this small, bounded verification process. Updating the counter before checking for a blank input incorrectly counts blank entries; failing to update it after a wrong OTP may allow unlimited attempts.)
/E (A recursive function could accept the number of attempts remaining and call itself after a wrong OTP. All approaches take O\(a\) time for a attempts. A loop uses O\(1\) auxiliary space; recursion uses O\(a\) call-stack space. A loop is preferable for this small, bounded verification process. Updating the counter before checking for a blank input incorrectly counts blank entries; failing to update it after a wrong OTP may allow unlimited attempts.)
